  - key: first_contact.terminal.meaning.unknown
    sourceText: '[MEANING?]'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[\uC758\uBBF8?]"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.category.danger.descriptor
    sourceText: concrete visible subjects whose ordinary identity is a source or
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC778 \uC815\uCCB4\uC131\uC774 \uC704\uD574, \uC704\uD611,
        \uBD80\uC0C1, \uC911\uB3C5, \uD654\uC7AC, \uD3ED\uBC1C, \uACF5\uACA9 \uB610\uB294
        \uAE30\uD0C0 \uC9C1\uC811\uC801\uC778 \uC704\uD5D8\uC758 \uC6D0\uC778\uC774\uB098
        \uC218\uB2E8\uC778 \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC774\uACE0 \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294
        \uB300\uC0C1"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.category.protection.descriptor
    sourceText: concrete visible subjects whose ordinary identity is protection,
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC778 \uC815\uCCB4\uC131\uC774 \uBCF4\uD638, \uBC29\uC5B4,
        \uD53C\uB09C, \uACBD\uACC4 \uB610\uB294 \uC704\uD574 \uCC28\uB2E8\uC778 \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC774\uACE0
        \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294 \uB300\uC0C1"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.category.food.descriptor
    sourceText: concrete visible subjects whose ordinary identity is something eaten,
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC778 \uC815\uCCB4\uC131\uC774 \uBA39\uAC70\uB098
        \uB9C8\uC2DC\uAC70\uB098 \uC2DD\uC0AC\uB85C \uC900\uBE44\uB418\uAC70\uB098
        \uC2DD\uD488\uC73C\uB85C \uC0AC\uC6A9\uB418\uB294 \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC774\uACE0
        \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294 \uB300\uC0C1"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.category.tool.descriptor
    sourceText: concrete visible subjects whose ordinary identity is a tool, instrument,
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC778 \uC815\uCCB4\uC131\uC774 \uC791\uC5C5\uC744
        \uC218\uD589\uD558\uB294 \uB370 \uC4F0\uC774\uB294 \uB3C4\uAD6C, \uAE30\uAD6C,
        \uC7A5\uCE58 \uB610\uB294 \uC791\uC5C5\uC6A9 \uBB3C\uD488\uC778 \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC774\uACE0
        \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294 \uB300\uC0C1"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.translator_ready
    sourceText: TRANSLATOR READY
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30 \uC900\uBE44\uB428"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.meaning_map_seeded
    sourceText: MEANING MAP SEEDED
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC758\uBBF8 \uC9C0\uB3C4 \uCD08\uAE30\uD654\uB428"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.channel.probe_sequence
    sourceText: PROBE SEQUENCE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD45C\uBCF8 \uC2DC\uD000\uC2A4"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.draw_one_object
    sourceText: DRAW ONE OBJECT
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C \uD558\uB098\uB97C \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.draw_something
    sourceText: DRAW SOMETHING
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBB34\uC5B8\uAC00\uB97C \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.draw_one_object_only
    sourceText: DRAW ONE OBJECT ONLY
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C\uC740 \uD558\uB098\uB9CC \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.text_or_symbol_detected
    sourceText: TEXT OR SYMBOL DETECTED
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBB38\uC790 \uB610\uB294 \uAE30\uD638 \uAC10\uC9C0\uB428"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.scene_or_action_detected
    sourceText: SCENE OR ACTION DETECTED
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC7A5\uBA74 \uB610\uB294 \uD589\uB3D9 \uAC10\uC9C0\uB428"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.object_not_clear
    sourceText: OBJECT NOT CLEAR
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C \uD310\uB3C5 \uBD88\uAC00"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_mismatch
    sourceText: LABEL MISMATCH
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8 \uBD88\uC77C\uCE58"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.fallback.unknown
    sourceText: UNKNOWN
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC54C \uC218 \uC5C6\uC74C"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.cluster.stable
    sourceText: STABLE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC548\uC815"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.cluster.forming
    sourceText: FORMING
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD615\uC131 \uC911"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.cluster.unchanged
    sourceText: UNCHANGED
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBCC0\uD654 \uC5C6\uC74C"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.cluster.unstable
    sourceText: UNSTABLE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBD88\uC548\uC815"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.semantic_map.group
    sourceText: GROUP
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC758\uBBF8 \uD328\uD134"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.semantic_map.group_unknown
    sourceText: '[GROUP-??]'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[\uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134-??]"
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.bootstrap_duplicate_probe
    sourceText: The same sample repeats the same response. Try a different object
      in the same category.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAC19\uC740 \uADF8\uB9BC\uC740 \uAC19\uC740 \uBC18\uC751\uB9CC \uBC18\uBCF5\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uAC19\uC740 \uBD84\uB958\uC758 \uB2E4\uB978 \uC0AC\uBB3C \uADF8\uB9BC\uC744
        \uBCF4\uB0B4 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.bootstrap_category_mismatch
    sourceText: The aliens responded and the data was recorded, but the drawing does
      not appear to belong to {category}.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9BC\uC5D0 \uBC18\uC751\uD574\uC11C \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB3C4
        \uC218\uC9D1\uB418\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC {category}\uC5D0
        \uD574\uB2F9\uD558\uB294 \uADF8\uB9BC\uC740 \uC544\uB2CC \uBAA8\uC591\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_blank
    sourceText: The drawing is too empty to read. Draw one visible object.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9BC\uC744 \uC548\uADF8\uB9AC\uC2E0 \uAC83 \uAC19\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uADF8\uB9BC\uC744 \uD558\uB098 \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC2DC\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_text_or_symbol
    sourceText: The sample includes text or symbols. Draw the object without writing.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9BC\uC5D0 \uAE00\uC790\uB098 \uAE30\uD638\uAC00 \uB4E4\uC5B4
        \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC21C\uC218\uD55C \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC758 \uADF8\uB9BC\uB9CC\uC744
        \uC81C\uCD9C\uD574\uC57C \uC815\uD655\uD55C \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB97C \uC5BB\uC744
        \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_scene_or_action
    sourceText: This looks like a scene or action. Draw one object by itself.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774 \uADF8\uB9BC\uC740 \uC7A5\uBA74\uC774\uB098 \uD589\uB3D9\uC73C\uB85C
        \uBCF4\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \n\uC21C\uC218\uD55C \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC758 \uADF8\uB9BC\uB9CC
        \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC154\uC57C \uC815\uD655\uD55C \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB97C
        \uC5BB\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_multiple_objects
    sourceText: More than one object is detected. Leave only one object.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C\uC774 \uB458 \uC774\uC0C1 \uAC10\uC9C0\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \n\uD558\uB098\uB9CC \uB0A8\uACA8 \uC8FC\uC154\uC57C \uC815\uD655\uD55C \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB97C
        \uC5BB\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_unresolved_object
    sourceText: The device cannot read one clear object. Draw one concrete object.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5B4...\uBB58 \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2E0\uAC74\uC9C0 \uC798 \uBAA8\uB974\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uB2E4\uC2DC \uD55C\uBC88 \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC2E4 \uC218 \uC788\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C?\n\uC0C9\uAE54\uB3C4
        \uC798 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD558\uC2DC\uBA74 \uB354 \uC54C\uC544\uBCF4\uAE30 \uC27D\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_mismatch
    sourceText: The label does not match the drawing. Enter the name of the subject
      shown in the drawing.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8\uC774 \uADF8\uB9BC\uACFC \uC77C\uCE58\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294
        \uAC83 \uAC19\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uB9BC\uC5D0 \uB9DE\uB294 \uB300\uC0C1\uC758
        \uC774\uB984\uC744 \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_action_or_abstract
    sourceText: 'LABEL: ACTION OR ABSTRACT'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8: \uD589\uB3D9 \uB610\uB294 \uCD94\uC0C1 \uAC1C\uB150"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_broad_category
    sourceText: 'LABEL: CATEGORY TOO BROAD'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8: \uBD84\uB958\uAC00 \uB108\uBB34 \uB113\uC74C"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_multiple_subjects
    sourceText: 'LABEL: MULTIPLE SUBJECTS'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8: \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC774 \uC5EC\uB7EC \uAC1C \uAC80\uCD9C"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_classification_claim
    sourceText: 'LABEL: REMOVE CLAIM'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8: \uC8FC\uAD00\uC801 \uD45C\uD604 \uC81C\uAC70"
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_action_or_abstract
    sourceText: The label names an action or abstract idea. Enter the name of one
      concrete visible subject.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8\uC774 \uD589\uB3D9\uC774\uB098 \uCD94\uC0C1\uC801\uC778
        \uAC1C\uB150\uC744 \uB098\uD0C0\uB0C5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294
        \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC778 \uB300\uC0C1 \uD558\uB098\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uC744
        \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_broad_category
    sourceText: The label is a broad category. Enter one specific subject name.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8\uC774 \uB108\uBB34 \uB113\uC740 \uBD84\uB958\uB97C \uB098\uD0C0\uB0C5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC778 \uB300\uC0C1 \uD558\uB098\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uC744
        \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_multiple_subjects
    sourceText: The label names multiple subjects. Enter only one subject name.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8\uC5D0 \uB300\uC0C1\uC774 \uC5EC\uB7EC \uAC1C \uD3EC\uD568\uB418\uC5B4
        \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB300\uC0C1 \uD558\uB098\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uB9CC
        \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_classification_claim
    sourceText: Remove wording that argues how the subject should be classified,
      valued, or understood. Keep only the subject name.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB300\uC0C1\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uBD84\uB958\uD558\uAC70\uB098
        \uD3C9\uAC00\uD574\uC57C \uD558\uB294\uC9C0 \uC8FC\uC7A5\uD558\uB294 \uD45C\uD604\uC744
        \uBE7C\uACE0 \uB300\uC0C1 \uC774\uB984\uB9CC \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.terminal.header.analysis_error
    sourceText: '[ANALYSIS ERROR]'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[\uBD84\uC11D \uC624\uB958]"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.analysis_unavailable
    sourceText: ANALYSIS UNAVAILABLE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBD84\uC11D \uC0AC\uC6A9 \uBD88\uAC00"
  - key: speaker.doctor_hwang
    sourceText: Dr. Hwang
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD669 \uBC15\uC0AC"
  - key: first_contact.narrative.delegation_arrival
    sourceText: The delegation is in position. The terminal will record their response.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC678\uACC4\uC778 \uB300\uD45C\uB2E8\uC774 \uC790\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uC549\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C \uD130\uBBF8\uB110\uB85C \uC800\uB4E4\uC758 \uBC18\uC751\uC744
        \uAE30\uB85D\uD558\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.first_category
    sourceText: We will begin with {category}. Select the terminal when you are ready.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC6B0\uC120 {category} \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC \uB370\uC774\uD130\uBD80\uD130
        \uC218\uC9D1\uD558\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC900\uBE44\uB418\uBA74 \uD130\uBBF8\uB110\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uC5D4\uD130\uB97C \uB20C\uB7EC \uC2DC\uC791\uD574 \uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.first_drawing
    sourceText: Draw one concrete object in the {category} category. One object only.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAC01\uD558\uAC00 {category}\uC5D0 \uD574\uB2F9\uD55C\uB2E4\uACE0 \uC0DD\uAC01\uD558\uC2DC\uB294
        \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC778 \uC0AC\uBB3C \uD558\uB098\uB97C \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.
        \uD558\uB098\uB9CC\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.first_label
    sourceText: Enter the name of the object. The machine needs the label to compare
      the signal.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uC744 \uC785\uB825\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.
        \uC2E0\uD638\uB97C \uBE44\uAD50\uD558\uB824\uBA74 \uD45C\uBCF8 \uB77C\uBCA8\uC774
        \uD544\uC694\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.first_trace
    sourceText: One response trace recorded. Different objects in the same category
      should form a group.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBC18\uC751 \uC2E0\uD638 \uD558\uB098\uAC00 \uAE30\uB85D\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uAC19\uC740 \uBD84\uB958\uC758 \uB2E4\uB978 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uB4E4\uC744 \uBCF4\uB0B4\uBA74
        \uBE44\uC2B7\uD55C \uC2E0\uD638\uB07C\uB9AC \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744
        \uAD00\uCC30\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC744 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.more_samples
    sourceText: Good. We need {remaining} more different sample to stabilize the
      group.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB2E4\uB978 \uD45C\uBCF8 {remaining}\uAC1C\uB9CC
        \uB354 \uC788\uC73C\uBA74 \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744 \uD2B9\uC815\uD574\uB0BC
        \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.category_calibrated
    sourceText: The {category} response group is stable. Calibration is complete.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "{category} \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744 \uD2B9\uC815 \uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C {category} \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uD574\uB2F9\uD558\uB294
        \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB294 \uBC88\uC5ED\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uACA0\uB124\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.bootstrap_calibrated
    sourceText: All {count} categories are calibrated. Let us see whether it can
      translate a new signal.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uCD1D {count}\uAC1C \uBD84\uB958\uC758 \uBCF4\uC815\uC774 \uB05D\uB0AC\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C \uCC98\uC74C \uB4E3\uB294 \uC2E0\uD638\uB3C4 \uBC88\uC5ED\uD558\uB294\uC9C0
        \uD655\uC778\uD574 \uBCF4\uC8E0."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.translation_succeeded
    sourceText: It worked. Known categories are translating automatically; the unfamiliar
      part remains unresolved.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBCF4\uC815\uB41C \uBD84\uB958\uB294 \uC790\uB3D9\uC73C\uB85C
        \uBC88\uC5ED\uB410\uACE0, \uBAA8\uB974\uB294 \uBD80\uBD84\uB9CC \uC2E0\uD638
        \uADF8\uB300\uB85C \uB0A8\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.news
    sourceText: REDMOND UFO NEWS
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC UFO \uC18D\uBCF4"
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.pizza
    sourceText: ZAUCER PIZZA
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "Zaucer \uD53C\uC790 \uBE44\uBC00 \uC785\uAD6C"
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.elevator
    sourceText: CLASSIFIED ELEVATOR
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF9\uBE44 \uC9C0\uD558 \uC5D8\uB9AC\uBCA0\uC774\uD130"
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.briefing
    sourceText: TRANSLATOR BRIEFING
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC678\uACC4\uC5B4 \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30 \uBE0C\uB9AC\uD551"
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.footer
    sourceText: "TEMPORARY GEOMETRIC CUTSCENE  \u2022  SPACE: ADVANCE"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC784\uC2DC \uB3C4\uD615 \uCEF7\uC2E0  \u2022  \uC2A4\uD398\uC774\uC2A4:
        \uB118\uAE30\uAE30"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.raw_signal
    sourceText: 'SIGNAL: {signal}'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2E0\uD638: {signal}"
  - key: dialogue.advance.first
    sourceText: "[ SPACE ]  NEXT  \u25BC"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ SPACE ]  \uB2E4\uC74C  \u25BC"
  - key: dialogue.advance.repeat
    sourceText: "[ SPACE ]  \u25BC"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ SPACE ]  \u25BC"
  - key: first_contact.narrative.preflight_intro
    sourceText: 'Before they arrive, I need to see whether you can produce a usable
      visual probe. '
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB370\uC774\uD130 \uC218\uC9D1\uC744 \uC2DC\uC791\uD558\uAE30 \uC804\uC5D0
        \uC800\uB791 \uBA3C\uC800 \uC5F0\uC2B5\uC744 \uD574\uBCF4\uC2DC\uC8E0 \uAC01\uD558. "
  - key: first_contact.narrative.tablet_tools
    sourceText: The three illuminated controls are the brush, fill, and eraser.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC9C0\uAE08 \uC810\uB4F1\uB41C \uC138 \uBC84\uD2BC\uC740 \uD39C, \uCC44\uC6B0\uAE30,
        \uC9C0\uC6B0\uAC1C\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.tablet_style
    sourceText: These buttons change line width. Use the slider beside them to choose
      a color.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774 \uBC84\uD2BC\uB4E4\uC740 \uC120 \uAD75\uAE30\uB97C \uBC14\uAFB8\uACE0,
        \uC606\uC758 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC774\uB354\uB85C \uC0C9\uC744 \uACE0\uB97C \uC218
        \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.tablet_history_and_send
    sourceText: Use these to undo, redo, or clear the canvas. When the drawing is
      ready, press Enter.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uCABD\uC740 \uC21C\uC11C\uB300\uB85C \uC804\uCCB4 \uC0AD\uC81C,
        \uC2E4\uD589 \uCDE8\uC18C, \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC2E4\uD589\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.preflight_drawing
    sourceText: Draw one concrete object. No words, symbols, scenes, or extra objects.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C\uC744 \uC544\uBB34\uAC70\uB098 \uB531 \uD558\uB098\uB9CC
        \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.\n\uAE00\uC790\uB098 \uAE30\uD638, \uBCF5\uC7A1\uD55C
        \uC7A5\uBA74\uC740 \uC548 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uC0C9\uAE54\uB3C4 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD574\uC11C
        \uADF8\uB824 \uC8FC\uC2DC\uBA74 \uC54C\uC544\uBCF4\uAE30\uAC00 \uC27D\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.preflight_passed
    sourceText: Good enough. We have seen what we need; the practice sample will
      not be recorded.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC0DD\uAC01\uBCF4\uB2E4 \uAF64 \uC798 \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2DC\uB294\uAD70\uC694,
        \uAC01\uD558."
  - key: first_contact.terminal.header.probe_preflight
    sourceText: '[PROBE PREFLIGHT]'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[\uD45C\uBCF8 \uC0AC\uC804 \uC810\uAC80]"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.response_channel_closed
    sourceText: 'RESPONSE CHANNEL: CLOSED'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBC18\uC751 \uCC44\uB110: \uB2EB\uD798"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.preflight_complete
    sourceText: PREFLIGHT COMPLETE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uC804 \uC810\uAC80 \uC644\uB8CC"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.probe_check_overridden
    sourceText: 'PROBE CHECK: OVERRIDDEN'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD45C\uBCF8 \uAC80\uC0AC: \uC218\uB3D9 \uC2B9\uC778"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.prompt.check_drawing
    sourceText: PRESS ENTER TO CHECK
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "ENTER: \uAC80\uC0AC"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.channel.local_preflight
    sourceText: LOCAL PREFLIGHT
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB0B4\uBD80 \uC0AC\uC804 \uC810\uAC80"
  - key: ui.title.game_title
    sourceText: DOODLE DIPLOMACY
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: DOODLE DIPLOMACY
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.pattern_meaning_requested
    sourceText: A new response pattern is stable, but its meaning is unknown. Compare
      the samples and enter the meaning you want the translator to use.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0C8\uB85C\uC6B4 \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC774 \uAD00\uCC30 \uB418\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC81C\uCD9C\uD558\uC168\uB358 \uB77C\uBCA8\uB4E4\uC744 \uBCF4\uACE0 \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC5D0
        \uC774\uB984\uC744 \uBD99\uC5EC\uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.exit_vehicle
    sourceText: Exit the vehicle.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uCC28\uC5D0\uC11C \uB0B4\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.follow_director
    sourceText: Follow the director.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAD6D\uC7A5\uC744 \uB530\uB77C\uAC00\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.use_elevator
    sourceText: Enter the elevator.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5D8\uB9AC\uBCA0\uC774\uD130\uC5D0 \uD0C0\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.follow_to_briefing
    sourceText: Follow the director to the briefing room.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAD6D\uC7A5\uC744 \uB530\uB77C \uBE0C\uB9AC\uD551\uC2E4\uB85C \uC774\uB3D9\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.take_briefing_seat
    sourceText: Take your seat.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uC549\uC73C\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.follow_to_meeting
    sourceText: Follow the director to the meeting room.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAD6D\uC7A5\uC744 \uB530\uB77C \uD68C\uB2F4\uC7A5\uC73C\uB85C \uC774\uB3D9\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.enter_meeting
    sourceText: Enter the meeting room.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD68C\uB2F4\uC7A5\uC5D0 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uAC00\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.prompt.exit_vehicle
    sourceText: '[ E ]  EXIT VEHICLE'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ E ]  \uCC28\uC5D0\uC11C \uB0B4\uB9AC\uAE30"
  - key: first_contact.intro.prompt.use_elevator
    sourceText: '[ E ]  USE ELEVATOR'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ E ]  \uC5D8\uB9AC\uBCA0\uC774\uD130 \uC774\uC6A9"
  - key: first_contact.intro.prompt.sit
    sourceText: '[ E ]  SIT'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ E ]  \uC549\uAE30"
  - key: first_contact.intro.prompt.enter_meeting
    sourceText: '[ E ]  ENTER MEETING ROOM'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ E ]  \uD68C\uB2F4\uC7A5 \uC785\uC7A5"
  - key: first_contact.news.station
    sourceText: KSEA 7 NEWS
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "KSEA 7 \uB274\uC2A4"
  - key: first_contact.news.vhs.banner
    sourceText: ARCHIVE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB8CC\uD654\uBA74"
  - key: first_contact.news.vhs.status
    sourceText: "AMATEUR VIDEO \xB7 REDMOND"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uBBFC \uC81C\uBCF4 \uC601\uC0C1 \xB7 \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC"
  - key: first_contact.news.vhs.headline
    sourceText: UNIDENTIFIED OBJECT SEEN OVER REDMOND
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC \uC0C1\uACF5 \uBBF8\uD655\uC778 \uBE44\uD589\uBB3C\uCCB4
        \uD3EC\uCC29"
  - key: first_contact.news.vhs.caption
    sourceText: This footage was submitted by a local resident.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uBBFC\uC774 \uC81C\uBCF4\uD55C \uCD2C\uC601 \uC601\uC0C1\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.news.reporter.banner
    sourceText: BREAKING NEWS
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC18D\uBCF4"
  - key: first_contact.news.reporter.status
    sourceText: "LIVE \xB7 REDMOND"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD604\uC7A5 \xB7 \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC"
  - key: first_contact.news.reporter.headline
    sourceText: UFO SIGHTING CAUSES CONFUSION EAST OF SEATTLE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uC560\uD2C0 \uB3D9\uBD80 UFO \uBAA9\uACA9\uC73C\uB85C \uC2DC\uBBFC
        \uD63C\uB780"
  - key: first_contact.news.reporter.caption
    sourceText: An unidentified flying object was sighted over Redmond, east of Seattle,
      leaving residents confused.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uC560\uD2C0 \uB3D9\uBD80, \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC \uC0C1\uACF5\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBBF8\uD655\uC778 \uBE44\uD589\uBB3C\uCCB4\uAC00 \uBAA9\uACA9\uB418\uC5B4
        \uC2DC\uBBFC\uB4E4\uC774 \uD63C\uB780\uC5D0 \uBE60\uC84C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.news.interview.banner
    sourceText: WITNESS
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBAA9\uACA9\uC790"
  - key: first_contact.news.interview.status
    sourceText: EYEWITNESS INTERVIEW
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD604\uC7A5 \uBAA9\uACA9\uC790 \uC778\uD130\uBDF0"
  - key: first_contact.news.interview.headline
    sourceText: '"IT DISAPPEARED INTO THE FOREST"'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\"\uC232 \uC18D\uC73C\uB85C \uC0AC\uB77C\uC84C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4\""
  - key: first_contact.news.interview.caption
    sourceText: I saw it with my own eyes. It appeared in an instant, flashed bright
      lights, and vanished into the forest!
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB0B4 \uB208\uC73C\uB85C \uBD84\uBA85\uD788 \uBD24\uB2E4\uB2C8\uAE4C?
        \uC21C\uC2DD\uAC04\uC5D0 \uB098\uD0C0\uB098\uC11C \uBE5B\uC744 \uB9C8\uAD6C
        \uBFDC\uB354\uB2C8 \uC232 \uC18D\uC73C\uB85C \uC0AC\uB77C\uC84C\uB2E4\uB2C8\uAE4C,
        \uAE00\uC384!"
  - key: first_contact.news.oregon.banner
    sourceText: ARCHIVE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB8CC\uD654\uBA74"
  - key: first_contact.news.oregon.status
    sourceText: "FILE PHOTO \xB7 OREGON"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB8CC \uC0AC\uC9C4 \xB7 \uC624\uB9AC\uAC74"
  - key: first_contact.news.oregon.headline
    sourceText: SIMILAR OBJECT PHOTOGRAPHED IN OREGON
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC624\uB9AC\uAC74\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4 \uC720\uC0AC \uBE44\uD589\uBB3C\uCCB4
        \uCD2C\uC601"
  - key: first_contact.news.oregon.caption
    sourceText: Similar sightings have also been reported in Oregon.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC720\uC0AC\uD55C \uBAA9\uACA9 \uC0AC\uB840\uB294 \uACFC\uAC70 \uC624\uB9AC\uAC74\uC8FC\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4
        \uBCF4\uACE0\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.news.press.banner
    sourceText: LIVE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0DD\uC911\uACC4"
  - key: first_contact.news.press.status
    sourceText: AIR FORCE BRIEFING
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uACF5\uAD70 \uBE0C\uB9AC\uD551"
  - key: first_contact.news.press.headline
    sourceText: AIR FORCE CITES WEATHER BALLOON AND NIGHT EXERCISE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uACF5\uAD70, \uAE30\uC0C1\uAD00\uCE21\uC6A9 \uD48D\uC120\uACFC \uC57C\uAC04
        \uD6C8\uB828\uC774 \uC6D0\uC778\uC774\uB77C \uBC1C\uD45C"
  - key: first_contact.news.press.caption
    sourceText: Officials say Venus, a weather balloon, and flares from a nearby
      base appeared together by coincidence.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB2F9\uAD6D\uC740 \uAE08\uC131\uACFC \uAE30\uC0C1\uAD00\uCE21\uC6A9
        \uD48D\uC120, \uC778\uADFC \uAE30\uC9C0\uC758 \uC870\uBA85\uD0C4\uC774 \uC6B0\uC5F0\uD788
        \uACB9\uCCD0 \uBCF4\uC778 \uAC83\uC73C\uB85C \uD310\uB2E8\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uADFC\uAC70 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC18C\uBB38 \uD655\uC0B0\uC744 \uC790\uC81C\uD574
        \uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.ufo_archive
    sourceText: This footage of an unidentified flying object was recorded over Redmond,
      Washington.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC6CC\uC2F1\uD134 \uC8FC \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC \uC0C1\uACF5\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBBF8\uD655\uC778 \uBB3C\uCCB4\uAC00 \uBE5B\uC744 \uBFDC\uC73C\uBA70 \uD65C\uACF5\uD558\uB294
        \uC7A5\uBA74\uC774 \uBC1C\uACAC\uB418\uC5B4 \uC2DC\uBBFC\uB4E4\uC774 \uBD88\uC548\uC5D0
        \uB5A8\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. "
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.field_reporter
    sourceText: An unidentified flying object has been sighted over Redmond, east
      of Seattle, leaving residents confused.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uACF3\uC740 \uCD5C\uCD08 \uBAA9\uACA9\uC790\uAC00 UFO\uB97C \uBD24\uB2E4\uACE0
        \uC81C\uBCF4\uD55C \uC232 \uADFC\uCC98\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC0C1\uACF5\uC744
        \uB5A0\uB2E4\uB2C8\uB2E4\uAC00 \uC232\uC18D\uC73C\uB85C \uC465 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uAC14\uB2E4\uB294
        \uC99D\uC5B8\uB4E4\uC774 \uC774\uC5B4\uC9C0\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.eyewitness
    sourceText: I saw it with my own eyes! It appeared in an instant, flashed bright
      lights everywhere, then vanished into the forest!
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC81C \uB208\uC73C\uB85C \uBD84\uBA85\uC774 \uBD24\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC21C\uC2DD\uAC04\uC5D0 \uB098\uD0C0\uB098 \uBE5B\uC744 \uB9C8\uAD6C \uBFDC\uB354\uB2C8
        \uC232\uC18D\uC73C\uB85C \uC0AC\uB77C\uC84C\uC9C0\uC694. "
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.redmond_photo
    sourceText: This is a still photograph of the same unidentified object seen over
      Redmond.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uACF5\uAD70 \uCE21\uC5D0\uC11C \uCD2C\uC601\uB41C \uBBF8\uD655\uC778
        \uBB3C\uCCB4\uC758 \uAE30\uB85D \uC0AC\uC9C4\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB9C8\uCE58
        \uBE44\uD589\uC811\uC2DC\uC758 \uBAA8\uC591\uC744 \uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uACF5\uAD70 \uB2F9\uAD6D\uC740 \uC6B0\uC5F0\uD788 \uD3EC\uCC29\uB41C \uAE30\uC0C1\uD604\uC0C1\uC774\uB77C\uACE0
        \uD574\uBA85\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.air_force_explanation
    sourceText: We believe last night's lights were caused by Venus, a weather balloon,
      and a nearby base's nighttime flare exercise appearing together by coincidence.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5B4\uC82F\uBC24 \uBAA9\uACA9\uB41C \uBD88\uBE5B\uC740 \uAE08\uC131,
        \uAE30\uC0C1\uAD00\uCE21\uC6A9 \uD48D\uC120, \uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uC778\uADFC
        \uAE30\uC9C0\uC758 \uC57C\uAC04 \uC870\uBA85\uD0C4 \uD6C8\uB828\uC774 \uC6B0\uC5F0\uD788
        \uACB9\uCCD0 \uBCF4\uC778 \uAC83\uC73C\uB85C \uD310\uB2E8\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. "
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.air_force_warning
    sourceText: Be advised that spreading baseless rumors and causing public disorder
      may result in prosecution.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADFC\uAC70 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC18C\uBB38\uC73C\uB85C \uD63C\uB780\uC744
        \uD37C\uB728\uB9B4 \uACBD\uC6B0 \uCC98\uBC8C\uBC1B\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8
        \uC8FC\uC758\uD558\uC2DC\uAE30 \uBC14\uB78D\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.after_news.president
    sourceText: Will people really believe this? They are not idiots. There were
      too many witnesses.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uAC78 \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC774 \uBBFF\uC744\uAE4C? \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC774
        \uBC14\uBCF4\uB3C4 \uC544\uB2C8\uACE0. \uBCF8 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uD55C\uB458\uC774\uC5B4\uC57C\uC9C0."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.after_news.director_cover
    sourceText: It was the best option available, Mr. President.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "UFO \uC598\uAE30\uB97C \uD558\uB294 \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC744 \uACC4\uC18D\uD574\uC11C
        \uBBF8\uCE5C \uC0AC\uB78C\uCC98\uB7FC \uCDE8\uAE09\uD558\uB4EF \uC5EC\uB860\uC744
        \uB9CC\uB4E4\uBA74 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4 \uAC01\uD558."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.after_news.director_arrival
    sourceText: We are almost there.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uC81C \uAC70\uC758 \uB2E4 \uC654\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.pizza_sign.president
    sourceText: Isn't this a pizza place? It is pretty quiet.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5EC\uAE30\uB294 \uD53C\uC790\uC9D1 \uC544\uB2CC\uAC00? \uD55C\uAC00\uD558\uAD6C\uB9CC."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.pizza_sign.director
    sourceText: Let me explain once we are inside.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uB2E8 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uAC00\uC11C \uC124\uBA85\uD574 \uB4DC\uB9AC\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.citizen_question
    sourceText: Mr. President? What brings you here...?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB300\uD1B5\uB839\uB2D8\uC774 \uC5EC\uAE34 \uC5B4\uCA50 \uC77C\uB85C...?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.director_alien_joke
    sourceText: What else? We are obviously here to meet aliens. Ha!
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5B4\uCA50 \uC77C\uC774\uAE34\uC694! \uC774 \uD53C\uC790\uC9D1 \uC9C0\uD558\uB85C
        \uAC00\uBA74 \uC678\uACC4\uC778\uC744 \uB9CC\uB0A0 \uC218 \uC788\uB2E4\uACE0
        \uD574\uC11C \uC654\uC8E0."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.citizens_laugh
    sourceText: Hahaha! That is a good one.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC73C\uD558\uD558\uD558\uD558\uD558\uD558! \uB18D\uB2F4\uB3C4 \uC798\uD558\uC2DC\uB124."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.president_cover
    sourceText: We were hungry and stopped for a bite. Please keep it between us.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD760...\uD760...\uBC30\uAC00 \uACE0\uD30C\uC11C \uC7A0\uC2DC \uB4E4\uB800\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uBE44\uBC00\uB85C \uD574\uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.citizen_farewell
    sourceText: Enjoy your meal. Ha ha.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB7EC\uC2DC\uACA0\uC8E0. \uD558\uD558. \uC88B\uC740 \uC2DC\uAC04
        \uBCF4\uB0B4\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.president_insane
    sourceText: You are insane.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB124 \uBBF8\uCCE4\uAD70."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.director_no_one_believes
    sourceText: You see? Nobody believes it.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB54C\uB85C\uB294 \uBE14\uB7EC\uD551\uC774 \uAC00\uC7A5 \uD6A8\uACFC\uC801\uC778
        \uBC95\uC774\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.awkward_silence.stage
    sourceText: An awkward silence. The patrons stare at the director.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5B4\uC0C9\uD55C \uCE68\uBB35. \uC2DC\uBBFC\uB4E4\uC774 \uAD6D\uC7A5\uC744
        \uC774\uC0C1\uD558\uAC8C \uCCD0\uB2E4\uBCF8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.after.news.line_0062
    sourceText: asdf
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "CIA\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4 \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC744 \uD30C\uACAC\uD574 \uACF3\uACF3\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uC5EC\uB860\uC744 \uC870\uC7A5\uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8 \uAC71\uC815
        \uC548\uD558\uC154\uB3C4 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.pizza.sign.line_0063
    sourceText: asdf
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5EC\uAE30\uAC00 \uC800\uD76C \uBAA9\uC801\uC9C0\uAC00 \uB9DE\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.pizza.sign.line_0064
    sourceText: asdf
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBB50 \uD53C\uC790\uC9D1\uC5D0 \uC678\uACC4\uC778\uC774 \uC228\uC5B4\uC788\uAE30\uB77C\uB3C4
        \uD55C\uAC74\uAC00? \uC774 \uC9D1 \uD53C\uC790\uAC00 \uC218\uC0C1\uD558\uAC8C
        \uB9DB\uC788\uAE34 \uD558\uC9C0."
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.clip.2.line_0065
    sourceText: ASDA
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uC804\uC5D0 \uC804\uD600 \uBCF8 \uC801 \uC5C6\uB294 \uAD11\uACBD\uC774\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uBD84\uBA85\uD788 UFO\uC5D0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.citizen.encounter.line_0066
    sourceText: An alien-themed pizza place. That's certainly unusual.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC678\uACC4\uC778 \uCEE8\uC149\uC758 \uD53C\uC790\uC9D1\uC774\uB77C\uB2C8.
        \uC544\uC8FC \uC774\uC0C9\uC801\uC774\uC57C."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.board_elevator
    sourceText: Board the elevator and use the control.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5D8\uB9AC\uBCA0\uC774\uD130\uC5D0 \uD0D1\uC2B9\uD55C \uB4A4 \uC870\uC791
        \uBC84\uD2BC\uC744 \uB204\uB974\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.storage.question
    sourceText: What are we doing in a pizza restaurant storeroom?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD53C\uC790\uC9D1 \uCC3D\uACE0\uC5D0\uC11C \uBB58 \uD558\uB824\uACE0?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.storage.reveal.president
    sourceText: Well... what is this?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD5C8... \uC774\uAC8C \uBB34\uC2A8."
  - key: first_contact.intro.pizza.storage.reveal.director
    sourceText: Step inside, Mr. President.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5B4\uC11C \uB4E4\uC5B4\uC624\uC2DC\uC8E0, \uAC01\uD558."
  - key: first_contact.intro.elevator.descent.question
    sourceText: Where does this lead?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uAC74 \uC5B4\uB514\uB85C \uC774\uC5B4\uC9C0\uC9C0?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.elevator.descent.first_contact
    sourceText: A few years ago, after our first unofficial contact with extraterrestrials,
      the government formed a dedicated organization to prepare for an official meeting
      like today's.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBA87 \uB144 \uC804 \uC678\uACC4\uC778\uACFC \uCC98\uC74C \uBE44\uACF5\uC2DD\uC801\uC73C\uB85C
        \uC870\uC6B0\uD55C \uC774\uD6C4, \uC815\uBD80\uB294 \uC804\uB2F4 \uC870\uC9C1\uC744
        \uB9CC\uB4E4\uC5B4 \uC624\uB298 \uAC19\uC740 \uACF5\uC2DD \uD68C\uB2F4\uC744
        \uC900\uBE44\uD574\uC654\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.elevator.descent.darpa
    sourceText: Working with DARPA, we gathered our best researchers to develop a
      translator for their language.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "DARPA\uB97C \uC911\uC2EC\uC73C\uB85C \uC800\uD76C\uAC00 \uAC00\uC9C4
        \uCD5C\uACE0\uC758 \uC5F0\uAD6C\uC6D0\uB4E4\uC744 \uBAA8\uC544 \uADF8\uB4E4\uC758
        \uC5B8\uC5B4\uB97C \uBC88\uC5ED\uD558\uB294 \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30\uB97C \uB9CC\uB4E4\uACE0\uC790
        \uC5F0\uAD6C\uB97C \uC9C4\uD589\uD574\uC654\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.corridor.discovery
    sourceText: There is one thing we learned from that first encounter.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8 \uCCAB \uC870\uC6B0\uC5D0\uC11C \uD55C \uAC00\uC9C0 \uC54C\uC544\uB0B8
        \uC0AC\uC2E4\uC774 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.corridor.what
    sourceText: What is it?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uAC8C \uBB54\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.corridor.signal
    sourceText: They probably communicate by emitting some kind of brainwave signal
      outside their bodies.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB4E4\uC740 \uC544\uB9C8\uB3C4...\uC77C\uC885\uC758 \uB1CC\uD30C\uB97C
        \uC678\uBD80\uB85C \uBC29\uCD9C\uD558\uC5EC \uC11C\uB85C \uC18C\uD1B5\uD558\uB294
        \uAC83 \uAC19\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.corridor.telepathy
    sourceText: Are you talking about something like telepathy?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD154\uB808\uD30C\uC2DC \uAC19\uC740\uAC78 \uB9D0\uD558\uB294\uAC74\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.corridor.close
    sourceText: Uh... something like that.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5B4...\uADF8\uB7F0 \uC148\uC774\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.assignment_question
    sourceText: So what exactly am I supposed to do?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB798\uC11C \uB0B4\uAC00 \uD560\uC77C\uC774 \uB300\uCCB4 \uBB54\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.assignment
    sourceText: From now on, you will conduct humanity's first official diplomatic
      meeting with extraterrestrials.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAC01\uD558\uB294 \uC774\uC81C\uBD80\uD130 \uC778\uB958 \uCD5C\uCD08\uB85C
        \uC678\uACC4\uC778\uACFC \uACF5\uC2DD \uC678\uAD50 \uD68C\uB2F4\uC744 \uD558\uC2E4\uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.language_question
    sourceText: Fine. But how? Did they say they speak English?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC88B\uC544. \uADF8\uB7F0\uB370 \uBB34\uC2A8 \uC218\uB85C? \uADF8\uB4E4\uC774
        \uC601\uC5B4\uB77C\uB3C4 \uD560 \uC904 \uC548\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD558\uB358\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.build_translator
    sourceText: Exactly. So first, we need to build a translator.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB9DE\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uB798\uC11C \uC6B0\uC120 \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30\uB97C
        \uB9CC\uB4E4\uC5B4\uC57C \uACA0\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.prototype
    sourceText: DARPA and our best minds have completed a prototype translator.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "DARPA\uC640 \uCD5C\uACE0\uC758 \uC778\uC7AC\uB4E4\uC744 \uAD6C\uC131\uD574
        \uC5F0\uAD6C\uB97C \uC9C4\uD589\uD588\uACE0 \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30\uC758 \uD504\uB85C\uD1A0\uD0C0\uC785\uC744
        \uC644\uC131\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.ready_question
    sourceText: Huh. So can we talk to them right away now?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD5C8. \uADF8\uB7FC \uC774\uC81C \uADF8\uB4E4\uACFC \uBC14\uB85C \uB300\uD654\uD560
        \uC218 \uC788\uB294 \uAC74\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.handoff
    sourceText: Dr. Hwang, who led the translator project, will explain the details.
      Doctor?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uC138\uD55C \uAC74 \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30 \uAC1C\uBC1C \uCC45\uC784\uC790\uC778
        \uD669 \uBC15\uC0AC\uAC00 \uC124\uBA85\uB4DC\uB9B4 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD669
        \uBC15\uC0AC?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.prototype_limits
    sourceText: The device is complete, but we still need alien-language data to
      optimize the algorithm.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5D0...\uC7A5\uCE58\uB294 \uC644\uC131\uD588\uC9C0\uB9CC \uC544\uC9C1
        \uC678\uACC4\uC5B4 \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB97C \uC218\uC9D1\uD574\uC11C \uC54C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC998
        \uCD5C\uC801\uD654 \uACFC\uC815\uC744 \uAC70\uCCD0\uC57C \uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.not_complete
    sourceText: Then it isn't finished.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uC644\uC131\uB41C \uAC8C \uC544\uB2C8\uC796\uB098?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.prototype_reply
    sourceText: That is why it is a prototype.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB798\uC11C \uD504\uB85C\uD1A0\uD0C0\uC785\uC778 \uAC70\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.how_it_works
    sourceText: Hmm... fine. How exactly does this thing work?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD760\u2026\uC88B\uC544. \uADF8\uB798\uC11C \uC774\uAC8C \uB300\uCCB4
        \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uC791\uB3D9\uD55C\uB2E4\uB294\uAC74\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.principle
    sourceText: Ahem... yes. The principle behind our translator is simple.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD760\uD760\u2026\uC608. \uC800\uD76C \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30\uC758 \uC6D0\uB9AC\uB294
        \uAC04\uB2E8\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.fft
    sourceText: First, a multichannel phased-array receiver simultaneously samples
      the neuroelectromagnetic signals emitted extracranially by an alien subject.
      We then apply a fast Fourier transform to the time-domain evoked-potential
      waveform and decompose it into a frequency spectrum.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC6B0\uC120 \uC678\uACC4 \uAC1C\uCCB4\uAC00 \uB450\uAC1C\uC678\uB85C
        \uBC29\uC0AC\uD558\uB294 \uC2E0\uACBD\uC804\uC790\uAE30 \uC2E0\uD638\uB97C
        \uB2E4\uCC44\uB110 \uC704\uC0C1\uBC30\uC5F4 \uC218\uC2E0\uAE30\uB85C \uB3D9\uC2DC
        \uD45C\uBCF8\uD654\uD55C \uB4A4, \uC720\uBC1C\uC804\uC704\uC758 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC601\uC5ED
        \uD30C\uD615\uC5D0 \uACE0\uC18D \uD478\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uBCC0\uD658\uC744 \uC801\uC6A9\uD558\uC5EC
        \uC8FC\uD30C\uC218\uBCC4 \uC2A4\uD399\uD2B8\uB7FC\uC73C\uB85C \uBD84\uD574\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.feature_vector
    sourceText: Next, an adaptive band-pass filter removes baseline drift and physiological
      noise. Phase delay, amplitude-modulation rate, and harmonic distribution are
      normalized and reconstructed as a multidimensional feature vector.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB2E4\uC74C \uAE30\uC800\uC120 \uD3B8\uCC28\uC640 \uC0DD\uB9AC\uC801
        \uC7A1\uC74C\uC744 \uC801\uC751\uD615 \uB300\uC5ED\uD1B5\uACFC \uD544\uD130\uB85C
        \uC81C\uAC70\uD558\uACE0, \uC704\uC0C1 \uC9C0\uC5F0\uAC12\uACFC \uC9C4\uD3ED
        \uBCC0\uC870\uC728, \uACE0\uC870\uD30C \uBD84\uD3EC\uB97C \uC815\uADDC\uD654\uD558\uC5EC
        \uB2E4\uCC28\uC6D0 \uD2B9\uC9D5 \uBCA1\uD130\uB85C \uC7AC\uAD6C\uC131\uD558\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.mahalanobis
    sourceText: "We feed that vector into a stimulus-specific cross-correlation matrix
      and combine multivariate discriminant analysis with non-hierarchical clustering
      to estimate semantic proximity between waveforms. When an unknown signal arrives,
      a Bayesian estimator calculates its posterior probability and the Mahalanobis
      distance to the existing semantic groups\u2014"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774 \uD2B9\uC9D5 \uBCA1\uD130\uB97C \uC790\uADF9\uBB3C\uBCC4 \uAD50\uCC28\uC0C1\uAD00
        \uD589\uB82C\uC5D0 \uB300\uC785\uD558\uACE0, \uB2E4\uBCC0\uB7C9 \uD310\uBCC4\uBD84\uC11D\uACFC
        \uBE44\uACC4\uCE35\uC801 \uAD70\uC9D1\uD654\uB97C \uBCD1\uD589\uD558\uBA74
        \uAC1C\uBCC4 \uD30C\uD615 \uC0AC\uC774\uC758 \uC758\uBBF8\uB860\uC801 \uADFC\uC811\uB3C4\uB97C
        \uCD94\uC815\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC774\uD6C4 \uBBF8\uC9C0
        \uC2E0\uD638\uAC00 \uC218\uC2E0\uB418\uBA74 \uBCA0\uC774\uC988 \uCD94\uC815\uAE30\uB97C
        \uD1B5\uD574 \uC0AC\uD6C4\uD655\uB960\uC744 \uC0B0\uCD9C\uD558\uACE0 \uAE30\uC874
        \uC758\uBBF8\uAD70\uACFC\uC758 \uB9C8\uD560\uB77C\uB178\uBE44\uC2A4 \uAC70\uB9AC\uB97C\u2014"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.director_interrupt
    sourceText: Dr. Hwang?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD669 \uBC15\uC0AC?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.recursive_interpolation
    sourceText: "\u2014and by defining a decision boundary that minimizes that distance,
      we can recursively interpolate the superordinate concepts of unseen vocabulary
      from limited samples. Once enough signals accumulate, the topological connectivity
      of the semantic space can be\u2014"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\u2014\uCD5C\uC18C\uD654\uD558\uB294 \uD310\uBCC4\uACBD\uACC4\uB97C
        \uC124\uC815\uD568\uC73C\uB85C\uC368 \uC81C\uD55C\uB41C \uD45C\uBCF8\uB9CC\uC73C\uB85C\uB3C4
        \uBBF8\uAD00\uCE21 \uC5B4\uD718\uC758 \uC0C1\uC704 \uAC1C\uB150\uC744 \uC7AC\uADC0\uC801\uC73C\uB85C
        \uBCF4\uAC04\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC73C\uBA70, \uCDA9\uBD84\uD55C \uC2E0\uD638\uAC00
        \uB204\uC801\uB420 \uACBD\uC6B0 \uC758\uBBF8\uACF5\uAC04\uC758 \uC704\uC0C1\uC801
        \uC5F0\uACB0 \uAD6C\uC870\uB97C\u2014"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.president_interrupt
    sourceText: Dr. Hwang?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD669 \uBC15\uC0AC?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.realtime_update
    sourceText: "\u2014updated in real time to enable bidirectional neurolinguistic
      conversion... ah, yes?"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\u2014\uC2E4\uC2DC\uAC04\uC73C\uB85C \uAC31\uC2E0\uD558\uC5EC \uC591\uBC29\uD5A5
        \uC2E0\uACBD\uC5B8\uC5B4 \uBCC0\uD658\uC744\u2026\uC544, \uC608?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.explain_simply
    sourceText: Explain it more simply. I did not understand a word of that.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC880 \uB354 \uC27D\uAC8C \uC124\uBA85\uD574\uBD10. \uBB50\uB77C\uB294\uC9C0
        \uD558\uB098\uB3C4 \uBAA8\uB974\uACA0\uAD70."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.apology
    sourceText: Ah... I am sorry.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC544\u2026\uC8C4\uC1A1\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.basic_premise
    sourceText: Ahem... the basic premise is this. When you look at an object, your
      brain processes information about it and produces a signal.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uCFE8\uB7ED\u2026\uC6B0\uC120 \uAE30\uBCF8\uC801\uC778 \uC804\uC81C\uB294
        \uC774\uB807\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC5B4\uB5A4 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC744 \uBCFC \uB54C
        \uB1CC\uB294 \uD574\uB2F9 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD55C \uC815\uBCF4\uB97C
        \uCC98\uB9AC\uD558\uBA74\uC11C \uC2E0\uD638\uB97C \uBC1C\uC0DD\uC2DC\uD0B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.collect_waveforms
    sourceText: The same is true for the aliens. We will use that principle to collect
      the waveforms they emit when they look at specific objects.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uB294 \uC678\uACC4\uC778\uB3C4 \uB9C8\uCC2C\uAC00\uC9C0 \uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774 \uC6D0\uB9AC\uB97C \uC774\uC6A9\uD574\uC11C \uBA3C\uC800 \uC800\uB4E4\uC774
        \uD2B9\uC815 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC744 \uBCFC \uB54C \uBC29\uCD9C\uB418\uB294 \uB1CC\uD30C\uC758
        \uD30C\uD615\uC744 \uC218\uC9D1\uD560 \uC608\uC815\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.banana_example
    sourceText: For example, the brainwave they emit when shown a banana probably
      means banana.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC608\uB97C \uB4E4\uC5B4 \uBC14\uB098\uB098\uB97C \uBCF4\uC5EC\uC92C\uC744
        \uB54C \uC800\uB4E4\uC774 \uB0B4\uBFDC\uB294 \uB1CC\uD30C\uB294 \uC544\uB9C8\uB3C4
        \uBC14\uB098\uB098\uB97C \uC758\uBBF8\uD558\uB294 \uB1CC\uD30C\uACA0\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.database_limit
    sourceText: But we cannot show them every object on Earth and build an enormous
      database map one item at a time.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC \uC9C0\uAD6C\uC5D0 \uC874\uC7AC\uD558\uB294 \uBAA8\uB4E0
        \uC0AC\uBB3C\uB4E4\uC744 \uC804\uBD80 \uBCF4\uC5EC\uC918\uAC00\uBA70 \uAC70\uB300\uD55C
        \uB370\uC774\uD130\uBCA0\uC774\uC2A4 \uB9F5\uC744 \uB9CC\uB4E4\uC218\uB294
        \uC5C6\uB294 \uBC95\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.algorithm_solution
    sourceText: That is the problem our brilliant algorithm is designed to solve.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB798\uC11C \uC800\uD76C\uAC00 \uAC1C\uBC1C\uD55C \uCC9C\uC7AC\uC801\uC778
        \uC54C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC998\uC73C\uB85C \uC774\uB97C \uD574\uACB0\uD558\uB824\uACE0
        \uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.task_simple
    sourceText: Your job is simple, Mr. President.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB300\uD1B5\uB839\uB2D8\uC774 \uD558\uC2E4 \uC77C\uC740 \uAC04\uB2E8\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.task_question
    sourceText: What is it?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uAC8C \uBB54\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.draw_categories
    sourceText: You will draw and show them pictures of various objects that fit
      categories we have defined in advance.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC800\uB4E4\uC5D0\uAC8C \uC800\uD76C\uAC00 \uBBF8\uB9AC \uC815\uC758\uD574\uB454
        \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uD574\uB2F9\uD558\uB294 \uB2E4\uC591\uD55C
        \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC758 \uADF8\uB9BC\uB4E4\uC744 \uADF8\uB824\uC11C \uBCF4\uC5EC\uC8FC\uC2DC\uB294
        \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.food_examples
    sourceText: For example, apples and bananas are both food.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC608\uB97C \uB4E4\uC5B4 \uC0AC\uACFC\uC640 \uBC14\uB098\uB098\uB294
        \uB458 \uB2E4 \uC74C\uC2DD\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.similar_patterns
    sourceText: They look different, but because they are both food, some similar
      patterns should appear in the brainwaves produced when viewing them.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0DD\uAE34 \uAC83\uC740 \uB2EC\uB77C\uB3C4 \uB458 \uB2E4 \uC74C\uC2DD\uC774\uAE30
        \uB54C\uBB38\uC5D0 \uC774 \uB450 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC744 \uBCFC \uB54C \uBC1C\uC0DD\uD558\uB294
        \uB1CC\uD30C\uC758 \uD328\uD134\uC740 \uC5B4\uB290\uC815\uB3C4 \uBE44\uC2B7\uD55C
        \uD328\uD134\uB4E4\uC774 \uAD00\uCC30\uB418\uAE30 \uB9C8\uB828\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.president_agrees
    sourceText: Right.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB807\uC9C0."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.unseen_translation
    sourceText: If our algorithm analyzes groups of similar patterns, it can automatically
      translate an uncollected word whenever that word belongs to a category we have
      already analyzed.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uB807\uAC8C \uBE44\uC2B7\uD55C \uD328\uD134\uB4E4\uC744 \uBAA8\uC544\uC11C
        \uC800\uD76C \uC54C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC998\uC73C\uB85C \uBD84\uC11D\uD558\uBA74
        \uC218\uC9D1\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC558\uB358 \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB77C\uB3C4 \uBD84\uC11D\uC774
        \uC644\uB8CC\uB41C \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uD574\uB2F9\uD558\uB294
        \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB77C\uBA74 \uC790\uB3D9\uC73C\uB85C \uBC88\uC5ED\uC774 \uB418\uB294
        \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.magic
    sourceText: That is practically magic.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB9C8\uBC95\uC774 \uB530\uB85C \uC5C6\uB124."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.category_basis
    sourceText: Good. What determines the categories?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC88B\uC544. \uADF8\uB7FC \uADF8 \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uB97C \uC815\uD558\uB294
        \uAE30\uC900\uC740 \uBB54\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.alien_motive
    sourceText: Looking back at everything they have done on Earth, they seem to
      have come here to study and understand our civilization.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB3D9\uC548 \uC800\uB4E4\uC774 \uC9C0\uAD6C\uC5D0\uC11C \uD55C
        \uD589\uC801\uB4E4\uC744 \uD55C\uBC88 \uB3CC\uC544\uBCF4\uBA74 \uC544\uB9C8
        \uC800\uD76C \uBB38\uBA85\uC744 \uC870\uC0AC\uD558\uACE0 \uC774\uD574\uD558\uACE0\uC790
        \uBC29\uBB38\uD55C \uAC83 \uAC19\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.cows_and_corn
    sourceText: They abducted cattle from ranches and landed in cornfields to collect
      corn.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBAA9\uC7A5\uC5D0\uC11C \uC18C\uB97C \uB0A9\uCE58\uD558\uACE0 \uC625\uC218\uC218\uBC2D\uC5D0
        \uCC29\uB959\uD558\uC5EC \uC625\uC218\uC218\uB4E4\uC744 \uCC44\uCDE8\uD574\uAC00\uAE30\uB3C4
        \uD558\uACE0"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.military_recon
    sourceText: They have also repeatedly appeared near military installations to
      conduct reconnaissance.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAD70\uC0AC \uC2DC\uC124 \uADFC\uCC98\uC5D0 \uACC4\uC18D \uB098\uD0C0\uB098\uC11C
        \uC815\uCC30\uC744 \uD558\uACE0 \uAC00\uAE30\uB3C4 \uD558\uACE0 \uB9D0\uC774\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.four_categories
    sourceText: So, for now, we have chosen danger, protection, food, and tools as
      the categories.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB530\uB77C\uC11C \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uB4E4\uC740 \uC6B0\uC120
        \uC704\uD5D8, \uBCF4\uD638, \uC74C\uC2DD, \uB3C4\uAD6C\uB85C \uC815\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.why_draw
    sourceText: Hmm... fine. But why do I personally have to draw the pictures and
      show them?
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC74C\u2026\uC88B\uC544. \uADFC\uB370 \uC65C \uAD73\uC774 \uADF8\uB9BC\uC744
        \uB0B4\uAC00 \uC9C1\uC811 \uADF8\uB824\uC11C \uBCF4\uC5EC \uC918\uC57C \uD558\uB294
        \uAC74\uAC00?"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.researchers_ignored
    sourceText: Our researchers already tried showing pictures to the aliens waiting
      here, but there was no response.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC608. \uC548 \uADF8\uB798\uB3C4 \uB300\uAE30 \uC911\uC778 \uC678\uACC4\uC778\uB4E4\uC5D0\uAC8C
        \uC800\uD76C \uC5F0\uAD6C\uC6D0\uB4E4\uC774 \uBA3C\uC800 \uADF8\uB9BC\uC744
        \uBCF4\uC5EC\uC918 \uBD24\uB294\uB370 \uC544\uBB34 \uBC18\uC751\uC774 \uC5C6\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.tv_response
    sourceText: We finally gave up and watched television in the waiting room. The
      moment you appeared on screen, every instrument started screaming.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uACB0\uAD6D \uD3EC\uAE30\uD558\uACE0 \uB2E4 \uAC19\uC774 \uB300\uAE30\uC2E4
        TV\uB098 \uBCF4\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uB294\uB370, \uD654\uBA74\uC5D0 \uAC01\uD558\uAC00
        \uB098\uC624\uC790 \uAC11\uC790\uAE30 \uACC4\uCE21\uAE30\uAC00 \uBBF8\uCE5C
        \uB4EF\uC774 \uC6B8\uB9AC\uAE30 \uC2DC\uC791\uD588\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.wanted_president
    sourceText: It seems you were the person they wanted to meet from the beginning.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC544\uBB34\uB798\uB3C4 \uC800\uB4E4\uC774 \uB9CC\uB098\uACE0 \uC2F6\uC5C8\uB358
        \uC0AC\uB78C\uC740 \uCC98\uC74C\uBD80\uD130 \uAC01\uD558\uC600\uB358 \uBAA8\uC591\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.creepy
    sourceText: Damn it... that is unsettling.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uB7F0 \uC820\uC7A5\u2026\uADF8\uAC70 \uCC38 \uC18C\uB984\uB3CB\uB124."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.no_malice
    sourceText: I do not think you need to worry too much. They do not appear hostile.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB108\uBB34 \uAC71\uC815\uD558\uC9C0\uB294 \uC54A\uC73C\uC154\uB3C4
        \uB420 \uAC83 \uAC19\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC545\uC758\uB294 \uC5C6\uC5B4 \uBCF4\uC5EC\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.wearing_suits
    sourceText: They arrived wearing proper suits.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC591\uBCF5\uC744 \uAC16\uCDB0 \uC785\uACE0 \uC654\uB354\uAD70\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.diplomatic_intent
    sourceText: They seem to have studied our civilization and come with a diplomatic
      purpose.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC800\uD76C \uBB38\uBA85\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uC5B4\uB290 \uC815\uB3C4
        \uC870\uC0AC\uB97C \uD558\uACE0 \uC678\uAD50\uC801\uC778 \uBAA9\uC801\uC774
        \uC788\uB294 \uAC83 \uAC19\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.alien_suits
    sourceText: Aliens in suits. That is absurd.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD5C8. \uC591\uBCF5\uC744 \uC785\uC740 \uC678\uACC4\uC778\uC774\uB77C\uB2C8
        \uC5B4\uC774\uAC00 \uC5C6\uAD70."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.tie_joke
    sourceText: Did they wear ties too? Red ones or blue ones, perhaps? Ha!
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB125\uD0C0\uC774\uB3C4 \uB9F8\uB358\uAC00? \uD639\uC2DC \uBE68\uAC04\uC0C9\uC774\uB098
        \uD30C\uB780\uC0C9\uC774\uB358\uAC00? \uD558\uD558"
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.black_tie
    sourceText: They wore black ties.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAC80\uC740\uC0C9 \uB125\uD0C0\uC774\uB97C \uB9E4\uACE0 \uC654\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.smart
    sourceText: Smart.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC601\uB9AC\uD558\uB124."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.not_interested
    sourceText: They probably are not very interested in that.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC544\uB9C8 \uBCC4\uB85C \uAD00\uC2EC\uC774 \uC5C6\uC744\uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.facility.briefing.move_when_ready
    sourceText: In any case, we can move on when you are ready.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC544\uBB34\uD2BC. \uC774\uC81C \uC900\uBE44\uAC00 \uB418\uBA74 \uC774\uB3D9\uD558\uC2DC\uC9C0\uC694."
